          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it waterproof?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The surface is sealed XPE foam, so milk, water and food sit on top of it instead of soaking in. Wipe it with a damp cloth and it is dry in seconds. There is no cover to unzip, no washing, and nothing for the foam core underneath to absorb.</p>"
