            "answer": "<p>You have 30 days from delivery to decide. Use it properly first, put the baby on it, wipe a spill off it, because that is what the 30 days are for. If it is still not right, contact us and we arrange pickup from your address. Prepaid orders are refunded to the original payment method.</p>"
